  "notes": "{配布|はいふ} is a noun that can function as a suru verb ({配布|はいふ}する). It implies distributing copies or items widely to many recipients.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- [thing]を{配布|はいふ}する (to distribute something)\n- [thing]が{配布|はいふ}される (something is distributed)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- チラシを{配布|はいふ}する (distribute flyers)\n- {資料|しりょう}を{配布|はいふ}する (distribute materials)\n- {無料|むりょう}{配布|はいふ} (free distribution)\n- {配布|はいふ}{物|ぶつ} (handout, distributed material)\n\nDistinct from {配達|はいたつ} (delivery), which implies bringing items to specific recipients. {配布|はいふ} emphasizes wider, less targeted distribution. Also distinct from {配給|はいきゅう} (rationing, supply distribution), which implies controlled allocation.",
